<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Verification Worksheet</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        td { padding: 5px 0; }
        .header-table td { padding: 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
            <div>
                <h1 style="font-size: 36pt; margin: 0;">KANSAS<br>WESLEYAN<span style="font-size: 24pt;">UNIVERSITY</span></h1>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align: right;">
                <h2 style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 0;">Office of Student Financial Planning,</h2>
                <p style="margin: 0;">K-Dub Hub, Pioneer Hall 285,</p>
                <p style="margin: 0;">100 E. Claflin, Salina, KS 67401</p>
                <p style="margin: 0;">Telephone: <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span> | FAX: <span data-field="fax">{{ fax }}</span></p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <h2 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-top: 20px;">2022-23 Institutional Verification Worksheet – V1 Dependent</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">(Contact: V1_Group)</p>

        <div style="border: 1px solid #000; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <p style="font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0;">IMPORTANT:</p>
            <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0;">Your FAFSA was selected by the U.S. Department of Education for a process called verification. The verification process will be conducted by Kansas Wesleyan University in accordance with U.S. Department of Education's rules 34 CFR Part 668. We must collect this information before awarding Federal Financial Aid. No further processing will be done until all documentation is provided.</p>
        </div>

        <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 5px; margin-top: 30px;">SECTION A: STUDENT INFORMATION</h3>
        <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 20%;">Student Name:</td>
                <td style="width: 20%;"><span data-field="student_first_name">{{ student_first_name }}</span></td>
                <td style="width: 20%;">First</td>
                <td style="width: 20%;">Middle Initial</td>
                <td style="width: 20%;">KWU Student ID # or Social Security Number</td>
                <td style="width: 20%;">Date</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Student Email address</td>
                <td colspan="5"><span data-field="student_email">{{ student_email }}</span></td>
                <td>Student Cell Phone number</td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 5px; margin-top: 30px;">SECTION B: FAMILY INFORMATION</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">List the people in your parents' household. Include:</p>
        <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 10pt;">
            <li><span data-field="household_member_1_description">{{ household_member_1_description }}</span></li>
            <li><span data-field="household_member_2_description">{{ household_member_2_description }}</span></li>
            <li><span data-field="household_member_3_description">{{ household_member_3_description }}</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 10px;">*****If you need more spaces, please attach a sheet with additional family members listed. *****</p>

        <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 25%;">Full Name</th>
                    <th style="width: 15%;">Age</th>
                    <th style="width: 30%;">Relationship to Student</th>
                    <th style="width: 30%;">College attending in 2022-23</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td><span data-field="family_member_full_name_1">{{ family_member_full_name_1 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="family_member_age_1">{{ family_member_age_1 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="family_member_relationship_1">{{ family_member_relationship_1 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="family_member_college_1">{{ family_member_college_1 }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <!-- Potentially more rows for family members -->
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <table style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 30%;">Office Use Only:</td>
                <td style="width: 20%; text-align: center;">#</td>
                <td style="width: 20%; text-align: center;">#</td>
                <td style="width: 30%;">Initials</td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
            <div>
                <h1 style="font-size: 36pt; margin: 0;">KANSAS<br>WESLEYAN<span style="font-size: 24pt;">UNIVERSITY</span></h1>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align: right;">
                <h2 style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 0;">Office of Student Financial Planning,</h2>
                <p style="margin: 0;">K-Dub Hub, Pioneer Hall 285,</p>
                <p style="margin: 0;">100 E. Claflin, Salina, KS 67401</p>
                <p style="margin: 0;">Telephone: <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span> | FAX: <span data-field="fax">{{ fax }}</span></p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 5px; margin-top: 30px;">SECTION C: INCOME INFORMATION (We need your 2020 tax and income information for student and parents. Parent section continues on next page.)</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Tax returns are Federal 2020 IRS Form 1040, Puerto Rican Tax Return, or a foreign income tax return.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Initial to the left which on the circumstance that is true for you regarding your tax filing status for 2020. If you will not file taxes for 2020, please be sure to include each employer and amounts earned from the work box below and attach copies of W-2 forms for all 2020 employers.</p>

        <h4 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 20px;">1. Student's 2020 Tax and Income Information</h4>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">I used the IRS Data Retrieval Tool within the FAFSA to link and transfer my 2020 income tax data into my FAFSA.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">I was unable to use the IRS Data Retrieval Tool within the FAFSA to link and transfer my 2020 income tax data; therefore, I attached a copy of my 2020 IRS Tax Return Transcript or a <span data-field="signed_copy_link">{{ signed_copy_link }}</span></p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">I did not and will not file a 2020 U.S. Income Tax Return because (initial one option that is true for you):</p>

        <table style="margin-top: 15px;">
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 50%; text-align: center;">I had zero earned or <span data-field="taxable_income_zero">{{ taxable_income_zero }}</span> taxable income in 2020</td>
                <td style="width: 50%; text-align: center;">I had too little taxable income to be required to file a tax return. <span data-field="please_complete_link">{{ please_complete_link }}</span></td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 30%;">Employer</th>
                    <th style="width: 25%; text-align: right;">Amount earned in 2020 ($)</th>
                    <th style="width: 25%; text-align: right;">W-2 Attached (Y/N)</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td><span data-field="student_employer_name_1">{{ student_employer_name_1 }}</span></td>
                    <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="student_amount_1">{{ student_amount_1 }}</span></td>
                    <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="student_w2_attached_1">{{ student_w2_attached_1 }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><span data-field="student_employer_name_2">{{ student_employer_name_2 }}</span></td>
                    <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="student_amount_2">{{ student_amount_2 }}</span></td>
                    <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="student_w2_attached_2">{{ student_w2_attached_2 }}</span></td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 5px; margin-top: 30px;">SECTION C: INCOME INFORMATION (Continued)</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Tax returns are Federal 2020 IRS Form 1040, Puerto Rican Tax Return, or a foreign income tax return.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Initial to the left which on the circumstance that is true for you regarding your tax filing status for 2020. If you or your spouse will not file taxes for 2020, please be sure to include each employer and amounts earned from the work box on page 3 and attach copies of W-2 forms for all 2020 employers.</p>

        <h4 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 20px;">2. Parent(s)' 2020 Tax and Income Information</h4>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">I used the IRS Data Retrieval Tool within the FAFSA to link and transfer my (our) 2020 income tax data into my FAFSA.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">I was unable to use the IRS Data Retrieval Tool within the FAFSA to link and transfer my (our) 2020 income tax data; therefore, I attached a copy of my (our) 2020 IRS Tax Return Transcript or a <span data-field="signed_copy_link_parent">{{ signed_copy_link_parent }}</span></p>

        <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 30%;">Employer</th>
                    <th style="width: 25%; text-align: right;">Amount earned in 2020 ($)</th>
                    <th style="width: 25%; text-align: right;">W-2 Attached (Y/N)</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td><span data-field="parent_employer_name_1">{{ parent_employer_name_1 }}</span></td>
                    <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="parent_amount_1">{{ parent_amount_1 }}</span></td>
                    <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="parent_w2_attached_1">{{ parent_w2_attached_1 }}</span></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><span data-field="parent_employer_name_2">{{ parent_employer_name_2 }}</span></td>
                    <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="parent_amount_2">{{ parent_amount_2 }}</span></td>
                    <td style="text-align: right;"><span data-field="parent_w2_attached_2">{{ parent_w2_attached_2 }}</span></td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
            <div>
                <h1 style="font-size: 36pt; margin: 0;">KANSAS<br>WESLEYAN<span style="font-size: 24pt;">UNIVERSITY</span></h1>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align: right;">
                <h2 style="font-size: 12pt; margin: 0;">Office of Student Financial Planning,</h2>
                <p style="margin: 0;">K-Dub Hub, Pioneer Hall 285,</p>
                <p style="margin: 0;">100 E. Claflin, Salina, KS 67401</p>
                <p style="margin: 0;">Telephone: <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span> | FAX: <span data-field="fax">{{ fax }}</span></p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 5px; margin-top: 30px;">SECTION D: SIGNATURES</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 15px;">WARNING: If you purposely give false or misleading information in establishing eligibility for federal student aid, you may be subject to Federal fine up to $20,000, a prison sentence, or both.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 15px;">By signing this worksheet, I (we) certify that all the information reported to qualify for federal student aid is complete and correct.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 10px;">*****At least one parent who is on the 2022-23 FAFSA must sign. *****</p>

        <table style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 30%;">Student Signature</td>
                <td style="width: 25%; text-align: center;">Date</td>
                <td style="width: 30%;">Parent Signature</td>
                <td style="width: 15%; text-align: center;">Date</td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <h4 style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 30px;">Parent Contact Information:</h4>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">The Office of Student Financial Planning will use this information to contact the parent to quickly resolve questions to prevent delays in processing your financial aid awards.</p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Parent Name: <span data-field="parent_contact_name">{{ parent_contact_name }}</span></p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Parent Email Address: <span data-field="parent_email">{{ parent_email }}</span></p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Parent Cell Phone: (<span data-field="parent_phone_area_code">{{ parent_phone_area_code }}</span>) <span data-field="parent_phone_prefix">{{ parent_phone_prefix }}</span>-<span data-field="parent_phone_line">{{ parent_phone_line }}</span></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>